body: 'To finish going live once World grants Selfie Check access: keep VERIFICATION_MODE=world + the WORLD_* creds + WORLD_ACTION=agentic-commerce-purchase (action registered), restart the API, run an agent purchase, open the SPA verify URL, complete the selfie in World App. Remaining hardening (post-access): verify the returned proof''s signal matches the target session (cross-session replay), confirm IDKit `environment` (staging vs production) if the widget errors after access is granted, and richer handling of the World verify response. This work is on branch feat/world-id-selfie-check (PR #6).'
